~ start_prison_rig_infiltration

Rebel Scout: Keep your head down! The Fire Warden's foundry guards patrol the upper catwalks.
Rebel Scout: Look by the western smokestack — [b]CoalVent_01[/b] is venting compressed iron-rich coal.
- Draw ore from the coal vent [if coal_vent_charges > 0]
